1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,862
Standing inside Lahori Gate, the covered passage called Chhatta-Chowk opens ahead of you.

2
00:00:06,812 --> 00:00:13,475
This roofed passage is flanked on both sides by double-storeyed arcaded apartments.

3
00:00:13,475 --> 00:00:18,750
It leads from the gate directly toward the palaces of the Red Fort.

